  title: Streaming System (1979)
  info: 'To address diverse learning abilities, the government introduced streaming,
    categorizing students into different academic paths (Express, Normal, and later
    Integrated Programmes). This system aimed to optimize individual potential but
    has since been refined to reduce stigma and promote flexibility.  '
